# The VLearn data pack lives at the repo root and must not be committed
# (data-pack rules: transcripts and slides stay inside the course).
# Anchored with a leading slash so the app's own data/ directory — which
# holds the built-in demo lesson — is still tracked.
/data/

# Generated at runtime inside the app: derived criteria, quizzes, logs.
